| `MLTableDetection/TableDetectorML.py` | ML table detection -- Table Transformer (DETR) for bounding-box-level panel detection. Default model path resolves to the fine-tuned v7 checkpoint at `~/Documents/TableAnnotations/models_v7/best/` and falls back to the HF pretrained `microsoft/table-transformer-detection` if no local checkpoint is found. See `_resolve_default_tatr_model_path()`. |
