| `MLTableDetection/render_pdfs_for_annotation.py` | Renders PDF pages to PNGs for annotation in Label Studio. |
| `MLTableDetection/pseudo_label.py` | TATR threshold-based pseudo-labeler -- routes rendered PNGs into auto_accepted / review / hard_negatives. |
